{"municipality_code":"14364","pref":"神奈川県","city":"山北町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"山北町には、川村向原、川村岸、川村山北など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「河村城跡」、「河村関所跡」、「谷ヶ関所跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、川村向原や川村岸にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 「洒水の滝」や「中川の箒杉」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":3,"rank":1182,"percentile":34.7,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":13,"rank":1500,"percentile":18.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":16,"rank":452,"percentile":74.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":17,"rank":886,"percentile":51.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["洒水の滝","中川の箒杉","中川温泉","